# Hermes Fleet Context (biotech-screener)

Before modifying agent-related code in this repo, load fleet context via Hermes MCP.

## Session Start (when touching scoped paths)

1. `fleet_context_snapshot()` -- one-call bounded bootstrap
2. If unavailable: `agents_list(include_heartbeat=true)` then `knowledge_read(artifact="held_spec_ledger")`

## Before Modifying a Specific Agent

1. `skills_read(name="<agent_name>")` -- read the SOUL.md (behavioral truth)
2. `agents_get(name="<agent_name>")` -- registry entry, heartbeat, file listing
3. `knowledge_read(artifact="contradiction_ledger")` -- check for known discrepancies

## Source of Truth (precedence, highest first)

1. Runtime wrappers / cron / production scripts (execution truth)
2. `agents/<name>/SOUL.md` / `IDENTITY.md` / `HEARTBEAT.md` (behavioral truth)
3. `agents/AGENT_REGISTRY.json` (index/discovery only)
4. Knowledge layer artifacts (operational state)
5. `.learnings/` (memory/reference)
6. `CLAUDE.md` / `.cursor/rules/` (IDE workflow constraints)

Registry metadata must never override runtime identity documents.

## Key Constraints

- All MCP tools are **read-only** -- no mutation from IDE sessions
- Lane A agents (deterministic) must not depend on LLM gateway tokens
- Only `crt_resolution_watcher` has `mutate_data` authority
- No agent has `mutate_config` -- operator-only
- Check `held_spec_ledger` before modifying constrained areas
- Architecture freeze ACTIVE — h20d DEFERRED (Path B, 2026-05-24); 13F quarantine ACTIVE (Jaccard 0.364, gate ≥0.70); no selector/ranker/sizing/KG changes authorized; earliest re-decision ~2026-06-15

## Agent Fleet Quick Reference

- 29 total: 29 active; 4 Hermes governance jobs (held-spec-ledger, first-fire-validator, ruleset-integrity, contradiction-detector). Retired overlaps removed 2026-05-30 (shadow_watch, policy_shadow_watch, bioshort_watch, company_news_ingest, biotech_news_digest).
- Model: DeepSeek v4 flash via OpenRouter (switched 2026-05-20; gateway fixed to openrouter primary 2026-05-25)
- Cron: 5:30 PM ET weekdays (daily production), 10:00 AM ET (universe maintenance)
- Monitoring: heartbeat -> supervisor -> post-snapshot -> sentinel (4-layer stack)
- Knowledge-layer cron checks (C1/C3) are authoritative on the **operator host** only; Cloud Agent VMs without `crontab` emit `UNKNOWN_CLOUD_ENV`, not hard contradictions
